WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
The word says RED. The ink is blue. Which answer reached you first?

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
In 1935, J. Ridley Stroop measured the effect of competing words on color naming.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
In one historical task, conflicting words made one hundred color responses take longer.

4
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:27.000
A measured delay is not a diagnosis. It tells us about a particular comparison.

5
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Twelve minutes of meditation audio is a session format. It is not evidence of an hour's benefit.

6
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Read the sources. Try a free exercise. Decide what fits. Final Vestige.
